  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize exposing and moving Aces to the foundations immediately. Without your Aces, you cannot clear any cards.\n\nColumn Management: Avoid creating empty columns unless you have a King ready to move into it. An empty column with no King is a wasted space that could have held card sequences.\n\nLook-Ahead Analysis: Since all cards are face-up, identify 'Blocks'. For example, if the 5 of Hearts is trapped under the 7 of Hearts, you must find a way to move the 7 before you can ever play that 5.",
    Player: "Prioritize exposing and moving Aces to the foundations immediately. Without your Aces, you cannot clear any cards.\n\nColumn Management: Avoid creating empty columns unless you have a King ready to move into it. An empty column with no King is a wasted space that could have held card sequences.\n\nLook-Ahead Analysis: Since all cards are face-up, identify 'Blocks'. For example, if the 5 of Hearts is trapped under the 7 of Hearts, you must find a way to move the 7 before you can ever play that 5.",
