    basic: 'Prioritize exposing and moving Aces to the foundations immediately. Without your Aces, you cannot clear any cards.',
    intermediate: 'Column Management: Avoid creating empty columns unless you have a King ready to move into it. An empty column with no King is a wasted space that could have held card sequences.',
